              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "**XML External Entity Injection**\n\nAttacks against applications that parse XML input\n\n**Impact (type metadata)**\nFile disclosure, SSRF, denial of service, or data theft\n\n**Mitigation (type metadata)**\nDisable DTDs and external entities in XML parsers, validate and sanitize inputs"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/psyray/oasis"
            }
          ]
        }
